{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-5405fc5acb06a3522ee5a64a8e7e325391372f87f96d786c","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"9d6f8cf1e149abbabd690b9136091efb211611a5dc3611a273d2cac3fa54cc6a","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Attached Form No. 19] <Amended on April 5, 2007>\n\n(Front)\n\nFact of [ ] Assessment / [ ] Payment of Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax\n[ ] Application for Certification  [ ] Certificate\n\nProcessing period: 3 days.\n\nApplicant (Taxpayer)\n\n| ① Name (representative) | ② Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ③ Business name (corporate name) | ④ Telephone number |\n| | |\n| ⑤ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n\nDetails to Be Certified\n\n<table>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">Taxpayer</th><th colspan=\"2\">Receiving party</th></tr>\n<tr><th>⑥ Name (representative)</th><td></td><th>⑦ Name (representative)</th><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>⑧ Business name (corporate name)</th><td></td><th>⑨ Business name (corporate name)</th><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>⑩ Resident (corporate) registration number</th><td></td><th>⑪ Resident (corporate) registration number</th><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>⑫ Address (head office location)</th><td></td><th>⑬ Address (head office location)</th><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>⑭ Location of manufacturing place</th><td></td><th>⑮ Location of manufacturing place</th><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>⑯ Business registration number</th><td></td><th>⑰ Business registration number</th><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nDetails of Taxable Articles\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>⑱ Date of sale / release</th><th>⑲ Name of article</th><th>⑳ Quantity</th><th>㉑ Specifications</th><th>㉒ Unit price</th><th>㉓ Price</th><th>㉔ Tax rate</th><th>㉕ Tax amount</th><th>㉖ Date of payment / assessment</th><th>㉗ Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n㉘ Matters for reference: __________________________________________________\n\nPlease certify the above details pursuant to Article 24 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office / Customs Office\n\nNo. ______\n\nI certify that the above details are correct.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nHead of the Tax Office / Customs Office: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\nRequired documents: None.\n※ This application form is provided free of charge.\nFee: None.\n\nGeneral paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office / customs office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare application</td><td>2. Receive application (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide (Final decision delegated to the department head)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>5. Prepare certificate (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe application proceeds from box 1 to box 2 on the right, then downward through boxes 3, 4, and 5. The final arrow from box 5 runs left and upward to the applicant and is labelled “Issue certificate.”\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\38ed9e5754e0166cd8b1494994ba228627283591dad82c866da36e2141e65f75.ascii.json","sha256":"38ed9e5754e0166cd8b1494994ba228627283591dad82c866da36e2141e65f75"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"36f861114285370ce57f0391cb27e595831124cb1fb8a6876d8f72eab5f0e8b7","unit_key":"form-001900F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"36f861114285370ce57f0391cb27e595831124cb1fb8a6876d8f72eab5f0e8b7","source_law_id":"kr-006574-270243-ko","source_review_complete":true,"source_xml_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","target_body_sha256":"e242eb87c0c249a5bbe276bd4d4646833fd6c4e24ce69620b926ec603e67da7c","unit_key":"form-001900F"},"unit_key":"form-001900F"}],"author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_errata\\concurrent_unit_recoveries_v1\\fe2bcf74de7dc8f114824401\\45b55aa48c6e341c8ad5\\recovered_translation\\en.title.json","sha256":"caf0dcf5c50a9f70581ce8b6bff50b953f3d3a7a30a17edbf83172f05b5f4e7e"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_errata\\concurrent_unit_recoveries_v1\\fe2bcf74de7dc8f114824401\\45b55aa48c6e341c8ad5\\recovered_translation\\en.units.parts\\form-001900F.json","sha256":"a94700248297274f372cd7548c002089a030e43000aaace989c393db1b36eb5c"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_e